GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{store2Ok.response.body.publicId}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{mgr2Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 27 — Close the first store, then read its report
# Expected: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeOk.response.body.publicId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 28 — Closed store: the report is gone with the store
